# Welcome to Live Markdown Editor

A fast, lightweight, and dependency-free **Markdown parser** built with HTML, CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript.

## Features at a glance
- **Real-time Live Preview:** Type on the left, see rendered output on the right.
- **Word & Character Counters:** Live stats update instantly.
- **File Exporter:** Download your files directly to your device.

---

### Code Sample
```javascript
function calculateWords(text) {
  return text.trim().split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean).length;
}
```

